      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KOBY KEEPING (1) settled down midfield and held his position to the line when finishing 4th (25.62) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from five starts. Should bounce back. OSCAR MAGIC (5) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 6 lengths at this track in a handy 19.39 beating Noaki Sea Breeze. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Sure to be thereabouts. UNWORLDLY (3) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame last run (25.44) at this track. Has a good record here including two wins. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to feature again. SHADOW CATCHER (2) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
